The '''Wither Spectre''' is a hostile [[Mob]]. They spawn in the left side of the {{Zone|Stronghold}} on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Behavior ==
If a player is nearby, '''Wither Spectres''' will quickly run towards them. Players hit by a Wither Spectre are temporarily afflicted with the Wither effect. Although Wither Spectres deal {{Stat|dmg|2000}}, they are one of the easiest types of monsters to defeat in the Crimson Isle.

